(:id "port/lobster/vt/block-read" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/lobstertable/block_form_test.go: TestLobsterBlockForm" "internal/codegen/lobstertable/block_form_forgery_test.go: TestLobsterBlockForgeries") :tested-revision "8a274684bed8e2d6c2f17f4046440349c6a619b1" :note "2026-11-05: the block form's reflective read (docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §19.2) reads both block images of the tables manifest through the emitted layout, holds the row dump to the pinned oracle byte for byte, and rebuilds each block through §19.1's builder; the block forgery battery opens or refuses every block image by the manifest's reason. Run at 8a274684b under the native Lobster archive.")
